WEBVTT

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:03.507
When she noticed me
glancing in the mirror as a kid,

00:05:03.549 --> 00:05:07.345
she decided to nip that
in the bud immediately

00:05:07.386 --> 00:05:11.766
by covering up
all the mirrors in the house.

00:05:11.807 --> 00:05:13.059
(Laughter)

00:05:14.685 --> 00:05:18.773
A loving compliment was,
"You have wonderful character,"

00:05:19.648 --> 00:05:22.234
not "You're beautiful."

00:05:22.234 --> 00:05:26.197
Oh, and character was built
by doing chores.

00:05:26.197 --> 00:05:27.656
(Laughter)

00:05:27.656 --> 00:05:31.577
When I wasn't mucking out the goat barn,
I was shearing sheep, changing tires,